d 'APCBOUND': module providing tools to facilitate the Fosse-Winship bounding approach to APC analysis
d
d  This package provides tools to facilitate the Fosse-Winship
d bounding approach to Age-Period-Cohort (APC) analysis. It
d includes 1) a command for producing unadjusted descriptive age,
d period, and cohort plots (apcdescribe), 2) a wrapper command for
d the estimation of APC models (apcest), 3) a command for
d optimizing bounded solutions for the linear components of APC
d effects given explicit assumptions (apcbound), and 4) a command
d for inspecting and visualizing APC effects, including fully
d bounded and semi-bounded solutions (apcplot). 
d
d KW: bounding approach
d KW: APC analysis
d
d Requires: Stata version 14 and palettes from SSC (q.v.)
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260820
d
d Author:  Gordey Yastrebov, Department of Sociology and Social Psychology, University of Cologne
d Support: email gordey.yastrebov@@gmail.com
d
f apcbound.ado
f apcbound.sthlp
f apcdescribe.ado
f apcdescribe.sthlp
f apcest.ado
f apcest.sthlp
f apcplot.ado
f apcplot.sthlp
